# MobiForge Cursor & AI Agent Rules

## Tech Stack & Architecture
- Framework: Flutter (Dart 3.x)
- Architecture: Clean Architecture (Feature-First) + SOLID Principles
- State Management: flutter_bloc & flutter_riverpod
- Network: Dio + Retrofit
- Dependency Injection: GetIt + Injectable
- Local Storage: Hive, FlutterSecureStorage, SharedPreferences
- Routing: GoRouter
- Immutability: Freezed & Equatable

## Guidelines
1. Do not place business logic in UI widgets. Delegate everything through UseCases.
2. Domain layer must be pure Dart without UI dependencies.
3. Repositories must catch exceptions and return `Either<Failure, T>`.
4. Always use `package:mobiforge/...` imports.
5. After modifying files with `@freezed` or `@RestApi`, run: `dart run build_runner build --delete-conflicting-outputs`.
